d first-principles thinking, scientific rigor, and rapid innovation, and we are looking for engineers who are open-minded, technically curious, and ready to solve some of the toughest challenges in aerospace propulsion&#10;</div><div><br></div><div><b>Responsibilities:&#10;</b></div><div>&#8226;&#160;<span>Design turbomachinery components from first principles</span></div><div>&#8226;&#160;<span>Review and optimization of existing designs</span></div><div>&#8226;&#160;<span>Optimization using analytical and 3D computational models</span></div><div>&#8226;&#160;<span>Work closely with materials team towards material selection</span></div><div>&#8226;&#160;<span>Work closely with fabrication team and vendors</span></div><div><br></div><div><b>Qualifications:&#10;</b></div><div>&#8226;&#160;<span>Experience in theory and design of turbomachinery components for propulsion systems.</span></div><div>&#8226;&#160;<span>Demonstrated capability to develop and validate new designs.</span></div><div>&#8226;&#160;<span>Ability to lead projects in a fast-paced environment solving multidimensional problems.</span></div><div>&#8226;&#160;<span>BE/MS in Mechanical Engineering, Aerospace Engineering or related fields</span></div><div>&#8226;&#160;<span>Understanding of machining processes</span></div><div>&#8226;&#160;<span>Understanding and experience with seals, bearings and lubrication</span></div><div>&#8226;&#160;<span>Knowledge of CAD tools and CFD, FEA using commercial or opensource software</span></div><div>&#8226;&#160;<span>Willingness to work in a fast paced, results oriented environment.</span></div><div>&#8226;&#160;<span>Some understanding of rotor-dynamics and balancing methods</span></div><div><br></div><div><b>What will you gain from this job:&#10;</b></div><div>&#8226;&#160;<span>End-to-end exposure to real-world jet engine development, including control systems, hardware realization, and flight testing.</span></div><div>&#8226;&#160;<span>Mentorship from experienced aerospace engineers and hands-on work with cutting-edge propulsion technologies.</span></div><div>&#8226;&#160;<span>Opportunity to work on advanced aerospace R&amp;D in high-speed transonic regimes, using both scientific and practical engineering approaches.</span></div><div>&#8226;&#160;<span>A strong stepping stone toward advanced careers in propulsion, flight control, embedded systems, or aerospace research.</span></div><div>&#8226;&#160;<span>Professional work environment with a five-day work week, standard benefits, and collaboration on world-class projects.</span></div>","additional_details":null,"is_notification_muted":true,"is_withdrawal_same_as_application_deadline":false,"is_new_company":false,"is_display_name_same_as_company_name":true,"is_included_in_application_matrix":false,"display_name":"Green Aero Propulsion Private Limited","is_published":true,"is_deleted":false,"is_process_completed":false,"created_by":9941,"created_by_name":"Hemanth Kukkunuri","updated_by":8527,"created_at":1764228248000,"updated_at":1764571149000,"company_query":{"overview":null,"city":null,"state":null,"zip":null,"pan":null,"contacts":null,"sourceHistory":null,"placecoms":null,"approved":false,"company_id":1249,"company_name":"Green Aero Propulsion Private Limited","source":null,"website_url":null,"logo":null,"industry":null,"address_line_1":null,"address_line_2":null,"is_approved":false,"is_disabled":false,"primary_placecoms":null,"secondary_placecoms":null,"created_by":9578,"updated_by":9578,"created_at":1764220027000,"updated_at":1764220027000},"questions":[],"documents":[{"documentName":null,"jd_document_id":853,"application_id":803,"document_id":14648,"user_id":9941,"document_type_id":5,"uuid":"86d24a80-9aaf-4567-ad09-11012d28b672","file_name":"TURBOMACHINERY ENGINEER","file_original_name":"04 Turbomachinery Engineer.pdf","file_extension":"pdf","file_path":"/datadrive/iisc-files/skynet-v2-files/9941-9941","file_size":"112 KB","file_name_in_path":"1764228245142_04Turbom